&lt;p style="font: 14pt/97% Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: left"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE 3 &#xFFFD; DEFERRED CHARGES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

