&lt;p style="font: 11pt/90% Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt/90% Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;Substantially all assets are pledged as security
on the notes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt/90% Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt/90% Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: left"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 14pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE 4 &#xFFFD;
LONG-TERM DEBT &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;(Continued)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;The note payable to Community Bank of Cameron was
issued under the U.S. Federal Government Coronavirus Aid, Relief, and Economic Security Act that, among other economic stimulus measures,
established the Paycheck Protection Program (PPP) to provide small business loans. The fixed rate of interest was 1%. The Company elected
to not seek forgiveness for the loan and paid the loan back in full. The maturity date was April 16, 2025. Monthly principal and interest
payments totaled $5,774.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;The loan payable to CAT Financial was issued for
a track loader. The fixed rate of interest is 0%. The maturity date is September 5, 2027. Monthly principal and interest payments total
$6,328.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;The loan payable to National Bank of Commerce was
issued for working capital. The fixed rate of interest is 7%. The maturity date is October 5, 2033. Monthly principal and interest payments
total $11,635.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;Approximate annual principal payments on the existing
long-term debt for the next five years are as &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;follows: 2026 - $159,766; 2027 - $147,193;
2028 - $96,391; 2029 - $103,360; and 2030 - $110,532.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt/90% Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: left"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: left"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 14pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: left"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE 5 &#xFFFD; PENSION BENEFIT OBLIGATION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Defined Benefit Plan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;The Company maintains a non-contributory defined
benefit pension plan which covers all full time employees of eligible age. Annual contributions are determined by actuarial valuations
prepared by an independent consultant, and are based upon the projected unit credit cost method for service cost and for the projected
benefit obligation, and the unit credit cost method for the accumulated benefit obligation. Employer contributions for the years ended
December 31, 2025 and 2024 were $144,000 and $123,000, respectively. The Company expects to make contributions of $239,000 to the Plan
in 2026. All contributions are paid to and invested by an independent insurance company. Plan assets were valued as of &lt;font style="font-weight: normal; text-transform: none"&gt;December
31, 2025&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font style="font-weight: normal; text-transform: none"&gt;2024&lt;/font&gt; and Plan liabilities were determined as of January
1, 2025 and 2024, and projected to &lt;font style="font-weight: normal; text-transform: none"&gt;December 31, 2025&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font style="font-weight: normal; text-transform: none"&gt;2024&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: left"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 14pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE 5 &#xFFFD; PENSION
BENEFIT OBLIGATION &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;(Continued)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt/90% Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: left"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

