&lt;p style="font: 12pt/90% Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;The projected pension benefit obligation included
in the table above represents the actuarial present value of benefits attributable to employee services rendered to date, including the
effects of estimated future pay increases.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt/90% Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: left"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt/90% Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;Weighted average assumptions used to determine
benefit obligations were as follows for the years ended December 31:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt/90% Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif"&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;
