&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;The Company has a revolving line of credit agreement
with Community Bank of Cameron providing the Company with loans up to $1,000,000 on a revolving basis with a maturity date of June 25,
2026. Interest is payable monthly at rates established by Community Bank, which is not to exceed the one year Treasury Index plus 2.5%.
The rate was 6.63% and 7.67% at December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;The Company has another revolving line of credit
agreement with National Bank of Commerce providing the Company with loans up to $2,000,000 on a revolving basis with a maturity date of
July 6, 2026. Interest is payable monthly at rates established by National Bank of Commerce, which is based on the Prime Rate as published
in the &#xFFFD;Money Rates&#xFFFD; section of the Wall Street Journal. The rate was 6.75% and 7.50% at December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 14pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE 7 &#xFFFD; DEMAND NOTES PAYABLE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

