&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;The interest rate on demand notes was 3.50% at December
31, 2025 and 2024. Demand notes in the amount of $506,500 and $511,500 as of December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively, are payable to
stockholder&#xFFFD;s of the company and these transactions would be considered related party transactions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 14pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE 8 &#xFFFD; DEFERRED TAXES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;Deferred taxes reflect the net tax effects of temporary
differences between the carrying amounts of assets and liabilities for financial reporting purposes and the amounts used for income tax
purposes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;Significant components of the Company&#xFFFD;s deferred
tax assets and liabilities as of December 31 are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 12pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

